                  This delay destroyed the conversational rhythm. We resolved this by refactoring into a <strong class="text-slate-200">multi-threaded, queue-based architecture</strong>. Audio listening, Gemma vision classification, and ElevenLabs speech generation run concurrently in non-blocking worker threads, maintaining conversational continuity and state retention across multi-turn user arguments.
                </p>
              </div>

